synthseg
Copyright 2026 Neurodesk contributors

Native port of SynthSeg 2.0 (https://github.com/BBillot/SynthSeg, Apache-2.0)
as shipped in FreeSurfer 8.1.0 `mri_synthseg`: preprocessing, U-Net inference
and postprocessing. Model checkpoint: synthseg_2.0.h5, re-exported to ONNX
without retraining. The Metal executor derives from exes/synthsr.

Billot B, Greve DN, Puonti O, et al. (2023). SynthSeg: Segmentation of brain
MRI scans of any contrast and resolution without retraining. Medical Image
Analysis 86:102789. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.media.2023.102789

